    "obs_and_metrics": [],
    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that interactively simulating stratospheric ozone chemistry in a climate model increases projected global warming by ~20% compared to using prescribed ozone, revealing a large ozone-circulation feedback involving tropical ozone, water vapour, and cirrus clouds often ignored in major climate assessments.",
